The table is adapted from these sources, both under CC BY-SA 3.0:

- StatCounter Global Stats, https://gs.statcounter.com/: the share of each version of Windows, and of each display size
  in CSS pixels, on desktops.
- The Firefox Public Data Report, Hardware Across the Web, by Mozilla, https://data.firefox.com/dashboard/hardware: the
  share of each display size in pixels, of each size of memory, and of each number of processor cores.

mitto's authors worked those shares into rows of weighted values, as docs/persona.md describes, and added weights where
no public source has them, which the table marks as the owner's. The table names each source with the period it comes
from.
